<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    World Smile Day: a smile is catching. A little cloud bobbing at the top right breaks into a big smile, and a
    moment later the pink flower at the bottom left catches it, grins back with a happy wiggle and a blush, a sparkle
    pops beside it, and the two settle back to soft smiles together. (No yellow smiley face: the characters are a
    cloud and a flower.)

    Every doodle is a 48dp square drawn around the widget's own 24dp G; see doodle_halloween.xml for the layout.
-->
